---
import ExtensionRef from "../../components/ExtensionRef.astro";
---

<ExtensionRef extension="loop" title="Loop" id="api-loop" files={["loop.min.js", "loop.min.css"]}>
  <p>
    Wraps from the last slide back to the first. Copies of the slides sit on both sides of the
    track, so scrolling never hits an end, and the slider moves back onto the real slides once the
    track comes to rest. The copies are hidden from screen readers, the tab order and forms.
  </p>
  <p>
    Copies of custom elements upgrade when they are inserted. A component that measures itself
    should do it in a <code>ResizeObserver</code>, not in its constructor.
  </p>
</ExtensionRef>
